--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 0ca23d3e41cd5424c9ec72c610ef25a4, type: 3}
  m_Name: LoadingScreenWEIRD
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  autoFocusSpeaker: 1
  screens:
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Hm. But there are still too many inconsistencies for us to literally
      be in the game.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Maybe this is the doing of that weird voice...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Voice man, did you bring me out here?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099842819752067
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099842819752068
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Do you even know where this is?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 99c1c9ab1bd810549a65874b102351c3, type: 2}
    dialog: I'm just as lost as you.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Dandy. Not even mystical forces beyond my understanding know where I
      am.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: I spin around, trying to see if I missed anything obvious.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Hello?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Can anyone hear me?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Oh. Hi...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099842819752069
    - rid: 268099842819752070
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Hey, look at that uniform!
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: You wouldn't happen to go to Sakura High by chance-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 884ec19fdaeec3c41a2119aa333adb2e, type: 2}
    dialog: You! Give me my life back!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099842819752071
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: ... What?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099842819752072
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 884ec19fdaeec3c41a2119aa333adb2e, type: 2}
    dialog: You've been living <i>my</i> life-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 884ec19fdaeec3c41a2119aa333adb2e, type: 2}
    dialog: <i>I'm</i> Sayori's best friend!
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 884ec19fdaeec3c41a2119aa333adb2e, type: 2}
    dialog: <i>I'm</i> the real {mc}!
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: ... What?!?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099842819752073
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: fdd5cfec9471d2f48a6134838a2b377b, type: 2}
    dialog: Where did {mc} go, he was supposed to have just learned Dragonrend-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099842819752074
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: fdd5cfec9471d2f48a6134838a2b377b, type: 2}
    dialog: Oh crap, you're not supposed to be here!
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 884ec19fdaeec3c41a2119aa333adb2e, type: 2}
    dialog: Give me my life back-!
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: fdd5cfec9471d2f48a6134838a2b377b, type: 2}
    dialog: We've been over this, no!
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: fdd5cfec9471d2f48a6134838a2b377b, type: 2}
    dialog: You're lucky I even gave you a window into what-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: fdd5cfec9471d2f48a6134838a2b377b, type: 2}
    dialog: Nevermind! Just shut up while I send the <SineText=5>real</SineText>
      {mc} back.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: What the hell is going on-?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099842819752076
    - rid: 268099842819752077
    - rid: 268099842819752078
    - rid: 268099842819752079
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: '{mc}, get up! Alduin''s here, do something!'
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099842819752081
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Huh?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099842819752082
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: I look up to the sky and see that, indeed, Alduin and Paarthurnax are
      fighting each other.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Ah. You're right.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: I'm gonna shout him out of the sky, so get ready Monika.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: <font=dragonfont>j8r z4 frul</font>!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099842819752083
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: I successfully nail Alduin with my shout and he comes crashing down.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099842819752086
    - rid: 268099842819752087
    - rid: 268099842819752088
    - rid: 268099842819752089
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Alright Monika, we've got a dragon to slay!
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099842819752090
    - rid: 268099842819752091
    - rid: 268099842819752092
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: c9971f7409084c140a7ff61c782e0c80, type: 2}
    dialog: Meyz mul, Dovahkiin. You have become strong.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099842819752094
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: c9971f7409084c140a7ff61c782e0c80, type: 2}
    dialog: But I am <i>Al-du-in</i>, Firstborn of Akatosh! I cannot be slain here,
      by you or anyone else!
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: c9971f7409084c140a7ff61c782e0c80, type: 2}
    dialog: You cannot prevail against me. I will outlast you... mortal!
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: With that last little quip to save face, Alduin flies away. Presumably
      to Skuldafn.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099842819752095
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: ... Monika?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Yeah? What's up?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099842819752100
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: While I was reading the Elder Scroll I, uh...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: I saw a guy who claimed to be the "real" {mc}.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099884709838862
    - rid: 268099884709838863
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: That's... uh...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099884709838864
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions: []
